# Line-ending policy (SP-039 pre-merge cleanup).
#
# The repository is developed on Windows; editor tooling has repeatedly
# re-written files to CRLF, inflating diffs (BACKLOG.md, package files).
# Policy: text files are stored with LF in the repository. Existing files
# committed with CRLF are NOT mass-renormalized here — they converge to LF
# individually as they are next modified, keeping diffs reviewable.
* text=auto
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
